<ul>
<li>Ingrid Thulin - Brita Randel</li>
<li>Gunnar Hellström - Albert Arnold, pengacara</li>
<li>Per Myrberg - Krister Langton</li>
<li>Georg Rydeberg - Edvard Cunning, wasit</li>
<li>Naima Wifstrand - Mrs. Wangendorff</li>
